Fallback used: {FALLBACK}

The temple entrance has been disabled because Burning Empires could not load a valid culture-specific temple scene and religion visibility level.

What happened:
{REASON}

Configuration involved:
Settlement: {SETTLEMENT}
Culture: {CULTURE}
Religion: {RELIGION}
Scene: {SCENE}
Requested level: {LEVEL}
Fallback level: {FALLBACK}

What the program did:
The temple menu entry was hidden so the player cannot enter an incorrect or empty scene. No settlement, religion, population, save, or scene data was changed.

How to fix it:
Open BE ModuleData Source Files/BEData/be_temple_scenes.json and correct the listed culture, religion, scene, or level mapping. Confirm that SceneObj/{SCENE}/scene.xscene contains the requested level, then run BE ModuleData Builder/BEModuleDataBuilder.exe validate, dry-run, and pack. Start a new test session and check the temple entrance again.
